      "en": "“Now give a pledge. Be collateral for me with yourself. Who is there who will strike hands with me?",
      "ko": "청컨대 보증물을 주시고 친히 나의 보주가 되옵소서 주 외에 나로 더불어 손을 칠 자가 누구리이까",
      "source_text_hash": "a63ea57eb3181f1dac39a1a76b375f2ef5de92861de6127334fec021f07a7186",
      "translation_text_hash": "4381926c5df04b3ff6f97fa038f13f4846fbc7fdcb4bfc04afe1e85ec4b1b3e0",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
