      "en": "Yet the righteous will hold to his way. He who has clean hands will grow stronger and stronger.",
      "ko": "그러므로 의인은 그 길을 독실히 행하고 손이 깨끗한 자는 점점 힘을 얻느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "2968bbc19c812d57addded499d58cf3ec0425b68b8f47aef80cce62cdb8d71cd",
      "translation_text_hash": "00b4d9c16065734072dd2c150270c5fa0678b5f1b33f243c3eb76e665eec77c0",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
